      "side": 1,
      "message": "With this patchset, following NPD issues in the source code shall be uncovered:\n1. Missing NULL check for \u0027mStream\u0027 in SurroundView2dSession::set2dConfig(): https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:hardware/interfaces/automotive/sv/1.0/default/SurroundView2dSession.cpp;l\u003d129;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d1\n2. Missing NULL check for \u0027mStream\u0027 in SurroundView3dSession::set3dConfig(): https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:hardware/interfaces/automotive/sv/1.0/default/SurroundView3dSession.cpp;l\u003d137;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d0\n\nAlso, there are two direct leaks in the source code:\n1. In SurroundView3dSession::SurroundView3dSession(), memory for framesRecord.frames.svBuffers[0].hardwareBuffer.nativeHandle is allocated but not freed - https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:hardware/interfaces/automotive/sv/1.0/default/SurroundView3dSession.cpp;l\u003d48;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d0\n2. In SurroundView2dSession::SurroundView2dSession(), memory for framesRecord.frames.svBuffers[0].hardwareBuffer.nativeHandle is allocated but not freed - https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:hardware/interfaces/automotive/sv/1.0/default/SurroundView2dSession.cpp;l\u003d38;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d0",
      "revId": "19f4098f9ec9e2a257c43874e05d3143d3a7737e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
